00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:38.820
but one of the most common is tap water
some places have hard water which contains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:44.160
more metal ions this is mostly calcium and&nbsp;
magnesium and they can interact with fatty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:49.380
acids and turn into tiny soap scum particles&nbsp;
which stick to your hair and make it feel dirty&nbsp;

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:53.940
fatty acids aren't really common in most&nbsp;
shampoos and conditioners anymore but you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.940 --> 00:05:58.140
do see them a lot in solid shampoo and&nbsp;
conditioner bars you might also see them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.140 --> 00:06:02.220
in natural soaps that are used as shampoos
these are some names that might show up in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:06.960
ingredient lists they can also be listed in the&nbsp;
