00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:16.680
fatty alcohols don't have this problem&nbsp;
and plant oils don't have this problem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:21.000
if there's no hydroxide base the reactive&nbsp;
groups stay tucked away in their structures&nbsp;

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:26.400
you do also have some fatty acids in your&nbsp;
